{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：中石化二季度炼油靠原油采购优化与11艘VLCC到港</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">中石化<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">88亿元</span>，显著超出市场此前20-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30亿元</span>的预期区间。这份<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>研报给出的解释很直接：公司在物流和运费成本高企、国内炼油毛利为负的环境下，靠原油采购优化和11艘霍尔木兹VLCC油轮的到港时机，把炼油板块从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>的盈利<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">187.88亿元</span>拉回到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>小幅亏损17.67亿元，整体业绩仍然录得正增长。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告同时上调了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>全年净利润预测<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">450亿元</span>，理由是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>油价按每桶90美元市价计算，以及原油采购成本好于预期。但下半年展望并不轻松，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>预计下半年净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">190亿元</span>，环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>。这份报告最值得看的判断是：中石化二季度的业绩弹性来自采购端的一次性优化，而非炼油主业的趋势性改善。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXsaUsKrUIE8iaGytribkRYz0nnVwic9dQ0jxky2giavTHemFnvk3EQyNichcIXjS8bLKJPY27Ao5Fe6m93hggY3AGslsYEMVOC7MlI/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>库存收益<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">51亿元</span>，炼油板块仍录得经营<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。中石化<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>确认了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">51亿元</span>的库存收益，其中炼油板块库存收益约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.7亿元</span>，营销和化工板块合计约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45.3亿元</span>。剔除库存因素后，炼油板块实际经营<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">23亿元</span>，对应每桶<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>0.7美元，而一季度还是每桶盈利6美元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告把炼油<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>归因于三项：航煤和喷气燃料毛利强劲、副产品价差坚挺、原油采购优化。这里的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">关键是</span>11艘霍尔木兹VLCC的到港时机——在运费高企的环境下，提前锁定低价原油并安排到港节奏，相当于把采购成本压了一块下来。但管理层自己也承认，国内汽油和柴油需求仍然偏弱，下半年国内成品油销量预计环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>，同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">51亿元</span>库存收益这个数字，它解释了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>净利润为何远<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>。简单说，库存收益是油价波动带来的账面利润，不是炼油加工费<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>的结果；剔除后炼油板块仍在<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>。我更关注的是三季度油价按90美元假设是否成立，这直接决定下半年库存收益还能不能复制。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVrnkw3hjCiaOFm5fmASVuuCtQfNIwa2WH0fjiayoZMMOmPXlpXyRmRQKqKfSicmSHVcZaic87eAiasNJ9rzO4SdHicZzzKV2yKUwYJk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 天然气产量指引上调至同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>，对冲LNG进口<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">中石化把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>天然气产量指引从同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>小幅上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>，对应下半年产量同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>。这个调整的背景是LNG进口业务在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>录得<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20亿元</span>经营<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>，而2025年全年还是40亿元经营利润。JPM预计全年LNG进口亏损约58.5亿元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">逻辑很清楚：提高自产天然气产量，减少对高价LNG进口的依赖。报告同时指出，中石油<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的天然气进口<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>可能因管道气进口成本下降而收窄，两家公司在天然气板块的走势出现分化。这里更值得关注的是中石化LNG进口单位<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>的每立方米0.35元扩大到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的0.94元，<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>幅度还在加深。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUgE3wBjjibxAgPQzMgTOqDk2FvDUqMlQWMP9Uic2xS9pQ3SzI6RDqDNesdOOEtaevHmGW7VxEbaIVMSSt8BgrsLicOM6oXKQExTo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2030年</span>资本开支年均<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1600亿元</span>，较十四五年均下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.5%</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层给出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2030年</span>每年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1600亿元</span>的资本开支指引，比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>水平高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>，但比十四五期间年均<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1710亿元</span>低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.5%</span>。2026年资本开支指引维持1316-1486亿元不变。这个数字组合传递的信号是：公司没有大幅调整研究，但也不再维持过去五年的高强度支出。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWf0exzp0mkpnMWTmxaRHkmG5yNXl48J0ENqWcn3qeJxRqcOfiaNCIfE40mOwhACSAwItrlMia2LVSsUGMHBQVaBo3HRUicianIcI8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 67-JPM-Sinopec A H-2Q refining aided by crude sourcing optimization and the arrival of 11 Hormuz VLCCs- guiding weaker 3Q upstream and chems earnings-260825</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
